Package: statGLM
Title: Statistical General Linear Models
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: person("Rameez Roshan PM", email = "rameezroshanpm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Clean-room implementation of general linear models, estimable
    functions, Type I, II, and III sums of squares, least squares means
    (marginal means), custom linear contrasts, multivariate analysis of
    variance, and modern publication-ready graphical displays matching SAS
    PROC GLM ODS Graphics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    stats,
    Matrix,
    ggplot2,
    gridExtra
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    car,
    MASS
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
